{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53201","headline":"诗偈 二十六 · 庞藴","name":"诗偈 二十六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"谁家郎君子，开眼造地狱。\n枉法取人钱，养那一羣贼。\n饶伊家户大，业成出不得。\n除非轮回满，换形偿他力。\n看君骑底驴，总是如此色。\n无事被鞭杖，有理说不得。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"庞藴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53201.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53201","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}